10. EXPLANATION OF MAJOR FUNCTIONS
create_empty_data(): Creates the initial customer dictionary and order list.
load_data(): Loads saved records from the JSON file and safely handles a missing or damaged file.
save_data(): Writes all records to campus_food_data.json.
show_menu_items(): Displays available food and drink items with prices.
register_customer(): Stores customer name, phone number and delivery location.
create_order(): Allows multiple items and quantities, then calculates subtotal, delivery fee and total.
display_order(): Displays the complete details of one order.
view_all_orders(): Displays all stored orders.
search_orders(): Searches using order ID or customer name.
update_order_status(): Changes the order's delivery status.
cancel_order(): Marks an undelivered order as Cancelled.
order_statistics(): Shows order counts and active-order revenue.
main(): Controls the repeating menu and program flow.
11. HOW THE SYSTEM WORKS
Start the program and load saved data.
